ProjectM TV: consume evaluated legacy display controls

Pass the frame context to legacy gamma/echo and filters. Allocate Filters for
every legacy composite, then skip inactive frames before touching GL state, so
equation-only activation works. Preserve filter order, gamma branches, echo
UV/orientation math and preset configuration defaults. Custom composites keep
their existing shader policy. Undefined echo orientation conversion omits echo.

Compatibility reference: MilkDrop3 code/vis_milk2/milkdropfs.cpp evaluated
gamma/echo (4064-4067), brighten/darken/solarize/invert (4199-4270).
Echo alpha is narrowed to float at 4065 before the float threshold at 4085.
Independent local repair; no MilkDrop3 implementation copied.
